Package: BARS
Version: 1.0-1
Date: 2006-11-01
Title: Bayesian Adaptive Regression Splines (BARS)
Author: Garrick Wallstrom
Maintainer: Rob Kass <kass@stat.cmu.edu>
Depends: R
Description: Solves the generalized nonparametric regression
 (curve-fitting) problem by assuming the function f(x) may be
 approximated with a cubic spline.  Utilizes reversible-jump 
 MCMC on the sets of knots, allowing the spline to adapt to 
 the data across the domain of x.  Currently available for 
 continuous responses (Normal errors) and counts (Poisson).
License: GPL version 2 or newer
URL: http://www.stat.cmu.edu/~kass/bars/bars.html
Packaged: Wed Nov  8 09:36:50 2006; bakalj
